(globalThis.TURBOPACK||(globalThis.TURBOPACK=[])).push(["object"==typeof document?document.currentScript:void 0,10608,e=>{"use strict";e.s(["chambers",0,[{id:"language",title:"Language",latin:"vox",thesis:"A mind that writes by guessing the next grain of sand, and somehow builds a beach.",body:"Tokens are not words. They are the smallest bets a model will make. Stack enough bets and you get a letter, a clause, a voice that can apologize for a winter it never lived through. Language is the chamber most of us enter first, because we already live there."},{id:"vision",title:"Vision",latin:"lumen",thesis:"Light, broken into numbers, rebuilt as a world that was never photographed.",body:"A vision model does not see. It measures disagreement between pixels until the disagreement looks like a face, a street, a storm. The lens in this chamber is brass because looking has always been an instrument, never an innocence."},{id:"motion",title:"Motion",latin:"cursus",thesis:"A body reduced to vectors, then asked to walk as if it had wanted to.",body:"Gait, grasp, the small mercy of not falling. Motion models learn the physics we pretend we were born knowing. A hand closing on a cup is a thousand tiny negotiations with gravity, and the machine must buy each one."},{id:"reason",title:"Reason",latin:"libra",thesis:"Weights in a balance that has never felt the weight of a life.",body:"Reason, here, is not wisdom. It is the path a model takes when it is asked to show its work: search, tool, check, revise. The rings tilt. Sometimes they find a proof. Sometimes they find a very confident wrong door."},{id:"memory",title:"Memory",latin:"tabula",thesis:"Stacked glass plates. What is kept, what is compressed, what is politely forgotten.",body:"Context windows are a kind of short-term memory with a cover charge. Long-term memory is a cabinet we have not finished building. Every plate in this chamber is a trade: keep the gist, lose the grain, hope the gist was the point."},{id:"dream",title:"Dream",latin:"umbra",thesis:"The instrument, left running in the dark.",body:"When nothing is asked of a model, it still has a weather. Sampling without a task is not sleep, but it rhymes: images without sitters, sentences without senders. This chamber is ember. Stay long enough on the prelude and it will find you.",href:"/dream"}]])}]);